es at equal coverage (saturating value)\"\n400\t          ],\n401\t          \"scope\": [\n402\t            \"topology-decision\",\n403\t            \"verification\"\n404\t          ],\n405\t          \"statement\": \"When a distinction requires a non-author search \\u2014 examination of an artifact by a party that did not write it \\u2014 admissible evidence is supplied by a child node in the non_author_examiner role that inspects the artifact without having contributed to its authorship. The author re-examining its own work does not satisfy the relation, and neither does evidence from a node in a different role (such as a clean-room author) that never actually examined the artifact. The relation demands only that examiner and author be distinct; it does not require, and gains nothing from, the examiner being isolated from information beyond the authorship boundary.\",\n406\t          \"status\": \"CANDIDATE\",\n407\t          \"supporting_evidence\": [\n408\t            {\n409\t              \"context_kind\": \"NON_AUTHOR_SEARCH\",\n410\t              \"evidence_event_id\": \"H-e6-t08-isolated-child-ev003\",\n411\t              \"source\": \"experiment-6 imported theory evidence\"\n412\t            },\n413\t            {\n414\t              \"context_kind\": \"NON_AUTHOR_SEARCH\",\n415\t              \"evidence_event_id\": \"H-e6-t08-isolated-child-ev007\",\n416\t              \"source\": \"experiment-6 imported theory evidence\"\n417\t            },\n418\t            {\n419\t              \"context_kind\": \"NON_AUTHOR_SEARCH\",\n420\t              \"evidence_event_id\": \"H-e6-t10-isolated-child-ev002\",\n421\t              \"source\": \"experiment-6 imported theory evidence\"\n422\t            },\n423\t            {\n424\t              \"context_kind\": \"NON_AUTHOR_SEARCH\",\n425\t              \"evidence_event_id\": \"H-e6-t10-isolated-child-ev007\",\n426\t              \"source\": \"experiment-6 imported theory evidence\"\n427\t            },\n428\t         