ent from the one that produced it \\u2014 admissible evidence is supplied by a node in the method_disjoint_verifier role whose check demonstrably uses a distinct method from the original derivation. Re-running the original method, even in a fully isolated fresh session, is replication rather than method-disjoint verification and does not satisfy the relation. Isolation matters here only insofar as it prevents the original method from leaking into the check; the evidential weight comes from the disjointness of methods, not from the isolation itself.\",\n          \"status\": \"CANDIDATE\",\n          \"supporting_evidence\": [\n            {\n              \"context_kind\": \"METHOD_DISJOINT_VERIFICATION\",\n              \"evidence_event_id\": \"H-e6-t03-isolated-child-ev002\",\n              \"source\": \"experiment-6 imported theory evidence\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"context_kind\": \"METHOD_DISJOINT_VERIFICATION\",\n              \"evidence_event_id\": \"H-e6-t03-isolated-child-ev007\",\n              \"source\": \"experiment-6 imported theory evidence\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"context_kind\": \"METHOD_DISJOINT_VERIFICATION\",\n              \"evidence_event_id\": \"H-e6-t06-isolated-child-ev003\",\n              \"source\": \"experiment-6 imported theory evidence\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"context_kind\": \"METHOD_DISJOINT_VERIFICATION\",\n              \"evidence_event_id\": \"H-e6-t06-isolated-child-ev008\",\n              \"source\": \"experiment-6 imported theory evidence\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"context_kind\": \"METHOD_DISJOINT_VERIFICATION\",\n              \"evidence_event_id\": \"H-e6-t14-branching-ev002\",\n              \"source\": \"experiment-6 imported theory evidence\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"context_kind\": \"METHOD_DISJOINT_VERIFICATION\",\n              \"evidence_event_id\": \"H-e6-t14-branching-ev007\",\n              \"source\": \"experiment-6 imported theory evidence\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"context_kind\": \"METHOD_DISJOINT_VERIFICATION\",\n              \"evidence_event_id\": \"H-e6-t14-isolated-child-ev002\",\n              \"source\": \"experiment-6 imported theory evidence\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"context_kind\": \"METHOD_DISJOINT_VERIFICATION\",\n              \"evidence_event_id\": \"H-e6-t14-isolated-child-ev007\",\n              \"source\": \"experiment-6 imported theory evidence\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"context_kind\": \"METHOD_DISJOINT_VERIFICATION\",\n              \"evidence_event_id\": \"H-e6-t20-isolated-child-ev004\",\n              \"source\": \"experiment-6 imported theory evidence\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"context_kind\": \"METHOD_DISJOINT_VERIFICATION\",\n              \"evidence_event_id\": \"H-e6-t20-isolated-child-ev008\",\n              \"source\": \"experiment-6 imported theory evidence\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"version\": 1\n        },\n        {\n          \"contradicting_evidence\": [],\n          \"falsifier\": \"the independent examiner's search is scored inadmissible where predicted admissible, or an isolated child strictly outperforms the examiner on the same search requirement at equal admissibility and equal coverage\",\n          \"id\": \"P-NONAUTHOR-SEARCH\",\n          \"parent_principles\": [\n            \"P-INDEPENDENCE\"\n          ],\n          \"preconditions\": [\n            \"feature:requires_nonauthor_search\"\n          ],\n          \"predicted_topology_effects\": [\n            \"adds an independent path with canonical role non_author_examiner\",\n            \"that path's evidence is admissible for NON_AUTHOR_SEARCH distinctions (required vector [0, 1, 0, 0])\",\n            \"cheaper admissible paths dominate costlier ones at equal coverage (saturating value)\"\n          ],\n          \"scope\": [\n            \"topology-decision\",\n            \"verification\"\n          ],\n          \"statement\": \"When a distinction requires a non-author search \\u2014 examination of an artifact by a party that did not write it \\u2014 admissible evidence is supplied by a child node in the non_author_examiner role that inspects the artifact without having contributed to its authorship. The author re-examining its own work does not satisfy the relation, and neither does evidence from a node in a different role (such as a clean-room author) that never actually examined the artifact. The relation demands only that examiner and author be distinct; it does not require, and gains nothing from, the examiner being isolated from information beyond the authorship boundary.\",\n          \"status\": \"CANDIDATE\",\n          \"supporting_evidence\": [\n            {\n              \"context_kind\": \"NON_AUTHOR_SEARCH\",\n              \"evidence_event_id\": \"H-e6-t08-isolated-child-ev003\",\n              \"source\": \"experiment-6 imported theory evidence\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"context_kind\": \"NON_AUTHOR_SEARCH\",\n              \"evidence_event_id\": \"H-e6-t08-isolated-child-ev007\",\n              \"source\": \"experiment-6 imported theory evidence\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"context_kind\": \"NON_AUTHOR_SEARCH\",\n              \"evidence_event_id\": \"H-e6-t10-isolated-child-ev002\",\n              \"source\": \"experiment-6 imported theory evidence\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"context_kind\": \"NON_AUTHOR_SEARCH\",\n              \"evidence_event_id\": \"H-e6-t10-isolated-child-ev007\",\n              \"source\": \"experiment-6 imported theory evidence\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"context_kind\": \"NON_AUTHOR_SEARCH\",\n              \"evidence_event_id\": \"H-e6-t11-isolated-child-ev003\",\n              \"source\": \"experiment-6 imported theory evidence\"\n            },\n            {\n        