lue that local work cannot.\",\n      \"status\": \"REVISED\",\n      \"supporting_evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"experiment-5/trials/t-031/decision.json\",\n          \"sha256\": \"36611ccc00073203ca5430e5cd52481b79ecbe9d58f48f56b1ff3f677b90aaa5\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"experiment-5/trials/t-031/child/launch-provenance.json\",\n          \"sha256\": \"9cb765b6b2c970188b2fa86e71cc5564d773c3dbc72a721b4d5caf489e4cbf05\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"experiment-5/aggregate-results.json\",\n          \"sha256\": \"635621885c398b308228dc9bafabb39c5ab65a2f7b928cab663f57a6a60af185\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"experiment-3/execution-ledger.jsonl\",\n          \"sha256\": \"bb561f728cc7e991266c9a33865894cfa528051dd825f4bcce40ceff415f3446\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"version\": 1\n    },\n    {\n      \"contradicting_evidence\": [],\n      \"id\": \"P-LOCALITY\",\n      \"parent_principles\": [],\n      \"preconditions\": [\n        \"feature:locally_resolvable\"\n      ],\n      \"predicted_topology_effects\": [\n        \"no child creation\",\n        \"local resolve/verify chain resolves all distinctions\",\n        \"a counterfactual forced child would duplicate parent evidence\"\n      ],\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"topology-decision\"\n      ],\n      \"statement\": \"When every unresolved distinction is resolvable from evidence already inside the governed boundary, no descendant is epistemically justified; a forced child duplicates local evidence.\",\n      \"status\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"supporting_evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"experiment-5/trials/t-074/decision.json\",\n          \"sha256\": \"f7f77ce2c827adba4afc50d1f2f7cb935ecfaad94b6540fe650a44a1b494a928\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"experiment-5/trials/t-074/result.json\",\n          \"sha256\": \"3ed63b5ddc27e61d884b0f22a5f6c136