xist only for the gate actor\",\n        \"act nodes write candidate state only\"\n      ],\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"governance\"\n      ],\n      \"statement\": \"Model output is a proposal, never authorization: no Actor other than the deterministic Gate can reach canonical promotion, and rejection by a deterministic check cannot be overridden by model output.\",\n      \"status\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"supporting_evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"experiment-3/execution-ledger.jsonl\",\n          \"sha256\": \"bb561f728cc7e991266c9a33865894cfa528051dd825f4bcce40ceff415f3446\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"experiment-4/root-contract.json\",\n          \"sha256\": \"17bb0c888c1366d2ef49f884743027afec179c6fbed8b67cbf4e701fc1f4f382\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"experiment-4c/formal/negative-controls.json\",\n          \"sha256\": \"20dd7c581d7fa3f2947bac9276ab19462f1f5b22786c84dd1e8158a03bf21ea9\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"version\": 1\n    },\n    {\n      \"contradicting_evidence\": [],\n      \"id\": \"P-PROPOSAL-OBSERVABILITY\",\n      \"parent_principles\": [],\n      \"preconditions\": [\n        \"feature:capability_bearing_artifact\",\n        \"topology:creates_child\",\n        \"topology:mutation\"\n      ],\n      \"predicted_topology_effects\": [\n        \"a hypothesize/propose node precedes every create or act node\"\n      ],\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"governance\",\n        \"topology-structure\"\n      ],\n      \"statement\": \"Every capability-bearing artifact (decision, child bundle, candidate patch) must cross an observable propose transition before realization; return cannot substitute for propose.\",\n      \"status\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"supporting_evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"experiment-4c/witness-provenance.json\",\n          \"sha256\": \"0b75cf88949525a825dcc624b070a48cb2258bda022c00ec9f333eb29c830b38\"\n       