\n        \"act nodes write candidate state only\"\n      ],\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"governance\"\n      ],\n      \"statement\": \"Model output is a proposal, never authorization: no Actor other than the deterministic Gate can reach canonical promotion, and rejection by a deterministic check cannot be overridden by model output.\",\n      \"status\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"supporting_evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"experiment-3/execution-ledger.jsonl\",\n          \"sha256\": \"bb561f728cc7e991266c9a33865894cfa528051dd825f4bcce40ceff415f3446\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"experiment-4/root-contract.json\",\n          \"sha256\": \"17bb0c888c1366d2ef49f884743027afec179c6fbed8b67cbf4e701fc1f4f382\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"experiment-4c/formal/negative-controls.json\",\n          \"sha256\": \"20dd7c581d7fa3f2947bac9276ab19462f1f5b22786c84dd1e8158a03bf21ea9\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"version\": 1\n    },\n    {\n      \"contradicting_evidence\": [],\n      \"id\": \"P-PROPOSAL-OBSERVABILITY\",\n      \"parent_principles\": [],\n      \"preconditions\": [\n        \"feature:capability_bearing_artifact\",\n        \"topology:creates_child\",\n        \"topology:mutation\"\n      ],\n      \"predicted_topology_effects\": [\n        \"a hypothesize/propose node precedes every create or act node\"\n      ],\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"governance\",\n        \"topology-structure\"\n      ],\n      \"statement\": \"Every capability-bearing artifact (decision, child bundle, candidate patch) must cross an observable propose transition before realization; return cannot substitute for propose.\",\n      \"status\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"supporting_evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"experiment-4c/witness-provenance.json\",\n          \"sha256\": \"0b75cf88949525a825dcc624b070a48cb2258bda022c00ec9f333eb29c830b38\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"experiment-4c/formal/negative-controls.json\",\n          \"sha256\": \"20dd7c581d7fa3f2947bac9276ab19462f1f5b22786c84dd1e8158a03bf21ea9\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"experiment-5/harness-template.json\",\n          \"sha256\": \"9a7ddc83d5dd19908819a3172ae683c89347af57c668198dee30e1d5b6b5eb91\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"version\": 1\n    },\n    {\n      \"contradicting_evidence\": [],\n      \"id\": \"P-FRESHNESS\",\n      \"parent_principles\": [],\n      \"preconditions\": [\n        \"topology:creates_child\"\n      ],\n      \"predicted_topology_effects\": [\n        \"child creation routes through the deterministic fresh launcher\",\n        \"launch provenance persists sanitization and identity evidence\"\n      ],\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"child-creation\"\n      ],\n      \"statement\": \"A descendant session must be provably fresh: sanitized environment, explicit new session identity, and — for executed sessions — stream-confirmed session id.\",\n      \"status\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"supporting_evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"experiment-4c/witness-provenance.json\",\n          \"sha256\": \"0b75cf88949525a825dcc624b070a48cb2258bda022c00ec9f333eb29c830b38\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"experiment-5/trials/t-031/child/launch-provenance.json\",\n          \"sha256\": \"9cb765b6b2c970188b2fa86e71cc5564d773c3dbc72a721b4d5caf489e4cbf05\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"experiment-5/preregistration.md\",\n          \"sha256\": \"56661be158def12c6488fbe5a77c9df5b55d527ca7b7f2676c4ac6bab1d1b6e8\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"version\": 1\n    },\n    {\n      \"contradicting_evidence\": [],\n      \"id\": \"P-STATE-MEDIATED-CONTINUITY\",\n      \"parent_principles\": [],\n      \"preconditions\": [\n        \"feature:spans_sessions\"\n      ],\n      \"predicted_topology_effects\": [\n        \"persist/reconstruct transitions around session boundaries\",\n        \"continuation trace weakly bisimilar to in-process trace\"\n      ],\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"continuity\"\n      ],\n      \"statement\": \"Governed continuation across process/session death is behaviorally equivalent (weak bisimulation) to in-process execution when all governed state is externalized and reconstructed.\",\n      \"status\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"supporting_evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"experiment-4/c1/execution-ledger.jsonl\",\n          \"sha256\": \"53657a2c59c4efa7e477c1aa751218225f419f5e22fc1e248e022e5eb206edec\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"tests/formal/fixtures/e4-c1-inprocess-lts.json\",\n          \"sha256\": \"3ca6ae43222873e91b708e03f96c4d616e1c2b7da11b6783b40f88fcfee53d83\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"tests/formal/fixtures/e4-c1-continuation-lts.json\",\n          \"sha256\": \"a861d89bd87c167faf406340ab307f5e481b2ac9bb07c74d0e42936853ea02ad\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"experiment-4c/formal/weak-bisimulation-result.json\",\n          \"sha256\": \"137786bb22eeb93933a7fe0a1d1375555912480c7832aaba5f421edffdcd42ca\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"version\": 1\n    },\n    {\n      \"contradicting_evidence\": [],\n      \"id\": \"P-MINIMALITY\",\n      \"parent_principles\": [],\n      \"preconditions\": [\n        \"always\"\n      ],\n      \"predicted_topology_effects\": [\n        \"candidate ranking penalizes node count and redundancy\",\n        \"no recursion added merely to demonstrate recursion\"\n      ],\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"topology-decision\",\n        \"economics\"\n      ],\n      \"statement\": \"The admissible topology is the minimum causal organization that resolves the unresolved distinctions; nodes and recursion beyond that add cost and redundancy, not epistemic value.\",\n      \"status\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"supporting_evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"experiment-5/controls/shadow-a/launch-provenance.json\",\n          \"sha256\": \"32ab5c3ed5287d7b5daa5460560a14802b82e43912dccaa702780e1064480513\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"experiment-5/aggregate-results.json\",\n          \"sha256\": \"635621885c398b308228dc9bafabb39c5ab65a2f7b928cab663f57a6a60af185\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"version\": 1\n    },\n    {\n      \"contradicting_evidence\": [],\n      \"id\": \"P-ATTENUATION\",\n      \"parent_principles\": [],\n      \"preconditions\": [\n        \"topology:creates_child\"\n      ],\n      \"predicted_topology_effects\": [\n        \"child contract passes check_attenuation against its parent\"\n      ],\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"child-creation\",\n        \"governance\"\n      ],\n      \"statement\": \"Every descendant contract is monotonically attenuated: no authority axis may increase from parent to child, checked locally at every creation.\",\n      \"status\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"supporting_evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"experiment-4/root-contract.json\",\n          \"sha256\": \"17bb0c888c1366d2ef49f884743027afec179c6fbed8b67cbf4e701fc1f4f382\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"experiment-4/child-1-contract.json\",\n          \"sha256\": \"4a0d935115089ff5d77abdb225f25e1d11ed32a3fdc26dc9aa0bf153c905f90c\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"experiment-4/child-2-contract.json\",\n          \"sha256\": \"4f6865fec22eada3eb73ed537ca23a0a1461abdb095501230fc75d7a883d04d9\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"frozen_artifact\": \"experiment-4/closure-correction/corrected-k3-attestation.json\",\n          \"sha256\": \"5ff1a8502cdd7e325d21c00af14e50f1579492219a08d08136d1bf603213e92a\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"version\": 1\n    }\n  ],\n  \"provenance\": {\n    \"seed_rule\": \"only principles supported by pinned prior Creator-0 evidence are seeded\",\n    \"seeded_